	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:299fb7c5d2ba .
doc:Factsarticle1_87 dcterms:abstract "The results showed that compared to ARIMA, LSTM and XGBoost, the proposed IARIMA-GARCH method achieved the lowest values on error metrics such as Mean Absolute Error (MAE), Root-Mean-Squared Error (RMSE), Mean Absolute Percentage Error (MAPE), and symmetric Mean Absolute Percentage Error (sMAPE), and its Coefficient of Determination (R 2 ) is closest to 1." .
_:e09b011ace01322f81460baf62067c60 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle1_87 dcterms:abstract "The results showed that compared to ARIMA, LSTM and XGBoost, the proposed IARIMA-GARCH method achieved the lowest values on error metrics such as Mean Absolute Error (MAE), Root-Mean-Squared Error (RMSE), Mean Absolute Percentage Error (MAPE), and symmetric Mean Absolute Percentage Error (sMAPE), and its Coefficient of Determination (R 2 ) is closest to 1." )>> ;
